Cell["\<\
Observe that the above three-dimensional graph contains the same \
characteristic directions as our two-dimensional graph of the characteristic \
curves in space and time.

Next, consider the case which includes decay:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"25e4c69a-9641-4e60-a9c6-75a3fc2880cc"],

